{"seq":1,"slug":"controversies","title":"争议","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"authorship-and-existence","title":"作者与生平之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/authorship-and-existence","wordCount":1812,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"interpretation-of-wu-wei","title":"无为的诠释之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/laozi/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/interpretation-of-wu-wei","wordCount":1625,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"争议\">争议</h1><p>本章客观地呈现围绕老子的主要争议。老子其人的真实性、《道德经》的作者与成书，以及对&quot;无为&quot;的诠释，是认识老子时需要审慎对待的问题。两篇文档，分别呈现作者与生平之争，以及无为的诠释之争，力求客观而严谨。</p>\n"}